 "rows": [
  {
   "caption": "THIS STRAW / ISN'T BROKEN",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 1.43,
   "first_word_s": 0.05,
   "last_word_s": 0.69,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.05,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "So why does it snap / at the water's surface?",
   "start": 1.43,
   "end": 4.68,
   "first_word_s": 1.5,
   "last_word_s": 2.88,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "Light from the straw / speeds up",
   "start": 4.68,
   "end": 6.16,
   "first_word_s": 4.75,
   "last_word_s": 5.85,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "as it leaves the water, / and changes direction.",
   "start": 6.16,
   "end": 9.13,
   "first_word_s": 6.23,
   "last_word_s": 8.17,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "Like a mower rolling / from grass to pavement:",
   "start": 9.13,
   "end": 11.65,
   "first_word_s": 9.2,
   "last_word_s": 10.92,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "one side / speeds up first.",
   "start": 11.65,
   "end": 13.78,
   "first_word_s": 11.72,
   "last_word_s": 12.94,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "Your brain traces the light / back in a straight line,",
   "start": 13.78,
   "end": 16.58,
   "first_word_s": 13.85,
   "last_word_s": 15.81,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "so the underwater part / looks higher.",
   "start": 16.58,
   "end": 20.33,
   "first_word_s": 16.65,
   "last_word_s": 18.01,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "That's why a pool looks / shallower from above:",
   "start": 20.33,
   "end": 22.89,
   "first_word_s": 20.4,
   "last_word_s": 22.14,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "about three quarters / of its real depth.",
   "start": 22.89,
   "end": 26.38,
   "first_word_s": 22.96,
   "last_word_s": 24.36,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
